---

description: Rails 8 conventions for the sample todo app
alwaysApply: true
-----------------

* Use Rails generators instead of hand-writing boilerplate.
* Use strong parameters for controller input.
* Keep migrations reversible.
* Prefer Rails conventions over custom implementations.
* Use partials for reusable view code.
* Prefer Turbo Streams over custom JavaScript when possible.
* Keep changes scoped to the Todo application.
